# Authentic Essentials – Product Website

A modern, responsive product website built with **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**, designed for showcasing products, collecting orders/inquiries, and delivering a smooth user experience across desktop and mobile.

This project focuses on **clarity, performance, and simplicity**, with clean UI patterns, responsive navigation, optimized product cards, and form handling via third‑party services (Formspree / Pageclip / EmailJS).

---

## ✨ Features

* **Responsive Navigation**

  * Desktop: Home + Products dropdown
  * Mobile: Hamburger menu with slide toggle
  * Active link underline on click

* **Product Pages**

  * Grid-based product layouts
  * Equal-height product cards
  * Text truncation with ellipsis for consistency
  * Dedicated product detail sections

* **Order / Inquiry Forms**

  * Clean, user-friendly form layout
  * Spam honeypot protection
  * Success & error feedback states
  * Optional thank-you page redirect

* **Email Handling Options**

  * Formspree (recommended for client delivery)
  * Pageclip (zero-JS alternative)
  * EmailJS (advanced templates & auto-replies)

* **Performance Optimizations**

  * Optimized Unsplash image usage
  * Lazy loading for images
  * Mobile-first styling approach

---

## 🧱 Tech Stack

* **HTML5** – semantic markup
* **CSS3** – Flexbox & Grid
* **JavaScript (Vanilla)** – interactions & form handling
* **Hosting** – Vercel (static deployment)

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
/project-root
│
├── index.html          # Home page
├── product.html        # Individual product pages
├── thank-you.html      # Form submission success page
│
├── /css
│   └── styles.css      # Global styles
│
├── /js
│   └── main.js         # Navigation & interactions
│
└── /assets
    └── images/         # Product & UI images
```

---

## 🧭 Navigation Behavior

### Desktop (≥ 1024px)

* Displays **Home** and **Products**
* Products expands into a dropdown list

### Mobile (< 1024px)

* Hamburger icon toggles full menu
* Dropdown converts to stacked list

---

## 🛍️ Product Cards

* CSS Grid ensures consistent alignment
* Fixed card height for visual balance
* Product titles and descriptions use ellipsis

```css
.product-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  height: 100%;
}

.product-card h3,
.product-card p {
  white-space: nowrap;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
}
```

---

## 📝 Forms & Email Handling


### Advanced: **EmailJS**

* Custom email templates
* Auto-replies supported
* Requires service ID, template ID & public key

---

## 🤖 Spam Protection (Honeypot)

Hidden input field to catch bots:

```html
<input type="text" name="company" style="display:none">
```

If this field is filled, submission is ignored.

---

## ✅ Thank You Page

After successful form submission, users are redirected to:

```
thankyou.html
```

Includes:

* Confirmation message
* Order reassurance
* Call-to-action back to home

---

## 🚀 Deployment

1. Push project to GitHub
2. Connect repository to **Vercel**
3. Deploy as a static site
4. Attach custom domain (optional)

---

## 🔧 Customization Notes

* Product details are fully editable in HTML
* Prices can be updated without affecting layout
* Email providers can be swapped without UI changes

---

## 📌 Best Practices Used

* Mobile-first design
* Semantic HTML
* Minimal JavaScript
* Client-friendly integrations
* Easy handover & maintenance

---

## 📞 Support & Maintenance

This project is designed for **easy client handover**. No complex backend or database is required. Future updates can be handled by simple content edits or UI tweaks.

